-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190719195126/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13#:~:text=But%20the%20creature%20stalked,the%20next%20several%20hours.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190719195126/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13","license":null,"text":"\"The Sea God's Labyrinth, Part 1\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 13 Nov 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13-e6","era":null,"summary":"Solon escapes through a collapsed hedge but loses his arrows and food.","participants":["solon"],"location":"the-labyrinth","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13","order":395,"story_date":"2013-11-13","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":27,"quote":"I had not only lost the beast, I had also lost my quiver of arrows and bags of dried fruit and meat.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190719195126/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13#:~:text=I%20had%20not%20only,dried%20fruit%20and%20meat.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Sea God's Labyrinth, Part 1","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-11-13","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190719195126/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13#:~:text=I%20had%20not%20only,dried%20fruit%20and%20meat.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190719195126/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/sea-gods-labyrinth-part-1-2013-11-13","license":null,"text":"\"The Sea God's